node.doctext:
I'm wondering how to do this better than my 4 line method.  Feels like I'm missing something obvious.  But example code below works

Basically I want to show weight * price = total but allow a minimum weight
but if it's a negative weight it should be the reverse of the above

Expected results:
2.3 = $23
.3 = $10
0 = $10
-.3 = -$10
-2.3 = -$23

<code>
$wt = $ARGV[0];

$min = 1;
$price = 10;

while ($wt ne '') {
	$nwt = abs($wt);
	$nwt = $min if $nwt<$min;
	$total = $nwt*$price;
	$total = -$total if $wt<0;

	print "Price: $total\n";

	print "Next Weight: ";
	chomp($wt = <stdin>);
}
</code>
